# Boost on 09's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# Rock Smash (HM06, received in 06) for the Ravaged Path rock (22,42); Bite (the starter's own level-22 move)
# in slot 3 as the one attacking move: neutral on the meadow grunts (TRAINER_GALACTIC_GRUNT_FLOAROMA_MEADOW_1
# STUNKY 13, _2 ZUBAT 11 x2) where Razor Leaf is resisted x0.25 by Zubat.
party-level 0 22
party-move 0 1 MOVE_ROCK_SMASH
party-move 0 2 MOVE_RAZOR_LEAF
party-move 0 3 MOVE_BITE
